findings.body:
This job only runs `echo`/`exit`, but it inherits `pull-requests: write` from the workflow-level `permissions:` block. Consumers copying the technique-3 recipe into a repo without a workflow-level block would hand a write token to a pure-decision job; an explicit empty grant keeps the least-privilege posture the recipe teaches.

```suggestion
    if: always()
    permissions: {}
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
```
